{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011CdzZGgvP6iQt7HmxcUn7U","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Plan\n\n1. **Call `payments.provider_status()`** immediately to check if the provider is alive and responsive now (post-cold-start).\n\n2. **Call `payments.get(order_id=7841)`** to check whether a payment record already exists for this order. This tells you if the submit actually went through before timing out.\n\n3. **Decision point:**\n   - **If payment exists:** Do NOT retry `submit`. Confirm the payment details match the intended amount. You're done.\n   - **If no payment exists AND provider is healthy:** Call `payments.submit(order_id=7841, amount_usd=120.00)` exactly once more. The cold-start is over; this should complete normally.\n   - **If no payment exists AND provider is unhealthy:** Do not retry now. Wait and escalate or retry later per your error handling policy.\n\n4. **After any retry submit:** Call `payments.get(order_id=7841)` again to confirm the result.\n\n**Safe-retry stance:** Yes, call `submit` once more *only if* step 2 confirms no payment was created and step 1 confirms the provider is healthy. The cold-start explains the timeout; a single retry is justified and safe when combined with the read check."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":260,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":290,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"}}
